  "description": "A .NET 10 reporting library. Define a report once as a single self-contained JSON document, then render it on screen with Blazor, export it to PDF (headless Chromium, so it matches the screen) or Excel, and author it in a drag-and-drop designer. Ships zero report styling — components emit stable pr-* class names for your own CSS. Server-side: it carries ADO.NET drivers and Playwright, so it does not run in WebAssembly.",
